      "raw": {},
      "title": "The difficulties sharing neuroscience data: can data publishing help?",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>Last week we published our first neuroscience data note containing 10GB of fMRI data hosted and integrated into the paper by a DOI to our GigaDB database. While we have published a number of genomics datasets and data notes (see the Puerto Rican Parrot genome data note and its associated data DOI), this is a nice example of us providing a home for \"orphan data\", the long tail of data types without community agreed curated repositories.</jats:p>",
